  "prompt": "Every purchase in Mailvora's export is sent by the billing server when a subscription's first payment comes in. Check December 2025: count the purchase events on the Dublin days 1 to 31 December by event_date, and count the subscriptions whose first payment (their earliest paid_at in payments) falls on those Dublin days. A first payment that was later refunded still counts on both sides, as the export keeps its purchase. Return three columns, in this order: export_purchases, backend_first_payments and difference (export_purchases minus backend_first_payments). Return one row. Any row order is fine.",
